{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Neuter Master</strong> \u2014 a lighthearted roguelite-meets-casual game where breeding animals, matching them on a grid, and giving the occasional <i>snip</i> are all part of the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses year by year, with each year divided into four distinct seasons:<br><strong>Spring</strong> \u2013 Unlock new tiles, activate fresh grid matches, and get ready for the summer rush.<br><strong>Summer</strong> \u2013 Send your animals into the field, let them mingle freely, and see what kind of offspring they produce!<br><strong>Autumn</strong> \u2013 Collect gold from your lineup, trigger slot-machine-style match bonuses, and pick powerful roguelike rewards.<br><strong>Winter</strong> \u2013 Manage your herd: feed them, sterilize \u201cproblem\u201d animals, or\u2026 send them into permanent retirement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match animals on a customizable grid to earn gold. Three in a row? Jackpot! Spend your gold to buy new animals or tiles, and breed your way to legendary traits through inheritance and surprising mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over-the-top cartoon visuals, diverse animal traits, and endless breeding combinations, every year becomes a chaotic yet strategic experiment in genetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to become the ultimate <strong>Neuter Master</strong>?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Animal Lover II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889950/151f4378ec53de731f189c38f7d04bd189bac831.jpg"},{"name":"Animal Lover III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889950/151f4378ec53de731f189c38f7d04bd189bac831.jpg"},{"name":"Animal Lover IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3889950/151f4378ec53de731f189c38f7d04bd189bac831.jpg"},{"name":"Animal Lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea